    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "RP2040 microcontroller board with castellated GPIO connections, USB, and on-board flash.\n\nThe official Pico-R3 archive identifies this as an R3 board reference. Presoldered-header variants are not asserted to be represented. The archive contains AppleDouble metadata in __MACOSX; that metadata is not a second model. Source documentation explicitly permits use, copying, modification, and distribution of Pico design files."
    }
